DATA TERMS (the MIT licence above covers the CODE only)

- WHO FluNet data (data/raw/flunet_*.csv and derived forecasts/scores): obtained
  from the World Health Organization's Global Influenza Surveillance and Response
  System (FluNet, https://www.who.int/tools/flunet). Used under WHO's terms for
  public-health, non-commercial purposes with attribution. Cite: "World Health
  Organization, FluNet, Global Influenza Surveillance and Response System
  (GISRS)". Redistribution here is for reproducibility only; do not use these
  files commercially.
- CDC FluSight forecast hub data (target data and FluSight-ensemble /
  FluSight-baseline forecasts, not stored in this repo; fetched from
  https://github.com/cdcepi/FluSight-forecast-hub): see that repository's
  licence and the US Government data terms it states.
- vendor/nabd_v2_kit: third-party companion code (see vendor/nabd_v2_kit/VENDORED.md).
- Synthetic files (labelled SYNTHETIC / SIMULATED) were generated by the author.
- Published figures quoted in pitch/ and research/ belong to their cited sources.
